 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1601949867438\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/c2cba460afa64f958cfd9cce0cc301c6_1601949867438_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Ghost Rider is on his way to crush the Hotel Inferno and defeat Mephisto!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Now, that Ghost Rider possess the throne of the world below,<br>\nhe can rightfully claim the title of the &lt;King of Hell&gt;!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">In addition to the latest Ghost Rider uniform,<br>\nhellfire will rain as his reign begins through the 10/7 Tier-3 Advancement!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Download the Patch data and check out the Ultimate Skill!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><s><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[10/7 3:22 a.m. (UTC+0) / 10/6 8:22 p.m. (PDT) Added]</span></span></span></s></p>\n\n<p><s><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The patch application is being delayed due to internal tests.<br>\nWe apologize to our Agents for the delay.<br>\nOnce the patch is completed, we will inform our Agents through this notice.</span></span></span></s></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">[10/7 4:27 a.m. (UTC+0) / 10/6 9:27 p.m. (PDT) Added]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">The patch has been completed. Please reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong>■ 10/7 Patch</strong></span><br>\n<strong>&nbsp; Patch Schedule:</strong> 10/7&nbsp;2:00 a.m. (UTC+0) / 10/6 7:00 p.m. (PDT)<br>\n<span style=\"color:#c0392b;\">* The patch will be applied in waves, so the patch application time may vary.<br>\n* The game can be played during the patch,&nbsp;<br>\nbut we recommend our Agents reconnect to the game to apply the patch once it is available.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Ghost Rider Tier-3</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1601949947594\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/7b5a9ba49c0e41e09ec99eff414e957f_1601949947594_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1601949954821\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/b9ef62a4580b40b1898ea84eb9a1c7b1_1601949954821.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Game Error Fixes</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. The issue where some flame visual effects of the bike are lost when Ghost Rider &lt;King of Hell&gt; is selected in Uniform Room has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Various events for King of Hell Ghost Rider and other September main heroes have been prepared!<br>\nDon’t forget to participate in the new Events!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"173\" id=\"1601950009890\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/819323369d954ae9be9e3acce56ba5a5_1601950009890_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"751\"></p>\n"
